# ============================================================================
# VAULT VARIABLES - SENSITIVE DATA (TO BE ENCRYPTED WITH ANSIBLE-VAULT)
# Located: ansible/inventories/production/group_vars/vault.yml
# This file contains all passwords, secrets, and API keys
# 
# IMPORTANT: 
# 1. Fill in all values with your actual secrets
# 2. NEVER commit this file to git without encryption
# 3. After filling values, encrypt with: ansible-vault encrypt ansible/inventories/production/group_vars/vault.yml
# 4. To edit: ansible-vault edit ansible/inventories/production/group_vars/vault.yml
# 5. To view: ansible-vault view ansible/inventories/production/group_vars/vault.yml
# ============================================================================

# ===== DATABASE CREDENTIALS =====
